offset_right = 502.99988
offset_bottom = 442.0
scale = Vector2(0.755, 0.755)
text = "- Press A / D to change section

- Hold CTRL and click to place a note on both grids

- Hold SHIFT and click to place a note in any Y position

- Click and drag to select notes, then press CTRL + C / CTRL + V
   to copy and paste. (also you can select which \"grid\" you want to 
   paste the notes by just overlaping your mouse on it)

- Press Q / E to change note length

- Press SPACE to play / pause the song

- Use W / S or the mouse wheel to scroll through the grid

- Click and drag to select notes, then press DEL to delete them"

